        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="5" corresp="#wit-h">Gif in cyninges tune·man mannan ofslea, L scill' gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#oliver" n="11" corresp="#wit-h">Gif in cyninges tune man mannan of slea, L scilƚ gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#oliver">If a person should kill someone in the king’s dwelling, let him pay 50 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough">If one man slays another on the king’s premises, he shall pay 50 shillings compensation.</ab>
